    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Learn the Secrets of the Multiverse</p></blockquote><p>The counsel of a Diviner is sought by those who want a clearer understanding of the past, present, and future. As a Diviner, you strive to part the veils of space, time, and consciousness, mastering spells of discernment, remote viewing, supernatural knowledge, and foresight.</p><h3>Diviner Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.029Ri0RqNG2FNcpT]{Divination Savant}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.AmufWZjJH6HSBgws]{Portent}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.HBTOOfga5H36Jpy8]{Expert Divination}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.TLITpCUid8RY8rdf]{The Third Eye}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.2MmoJNwJrDlgBWmB]{Greater Portent}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
